{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはなーこ(*ﾟvﾟ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝は、ブルガリアヨーグルトを食べて健康。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6B9R9FS2H8WMM5S2Y90GG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脂肪〇!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと･･･"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6BAQWK662FKJ9BFM0XXMX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nオムライス!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から幸せいっぱい❁\n朝ごはんが、朝昼夜の中で1番幸せな時間です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6BBTPNA76PWNX595SEQWS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n最近、仲良し〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オシャレになっていく よね。ちょっと寂しいような気がします。\n一緒に着てたセーターが懐かしい･･･。\n優しいよねさん、好きやで〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"糸引き飴。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6BCVHHR1KQQC62GXD724Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇な時に舐めてます。駄菓子屋さんでよく買っていました!\n中でも苺が好きです(♡˙︶˙♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日も1日頑張りましょう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}